{"id":"c682c089b3ac3182","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md","title":"Homotopy Group","display":"df-homotopy-group — Homotopy Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-homotopy-group","aliases":["58-df-homotopy-group","Homotopy Group"],"display":"df-homotopy-group — Homotopy Group","depends_on":["[[58-df-homotopy]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-group]]","[[58-df-sphere]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-homotopy-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-homotopy-group</span><span>Homotopy Group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-homotopy-group — Homotopy Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" href=\"?note=cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" title=\"58-df-homotopy\">58-df-homotopy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"58-df-group\">58-df-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ed44d43cf74ca35e\" href=\"?note=ed44d43cf74ca35e\" title=\"58-df-sphere\">58-df-sphere</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> (homotopy-group degree)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,x_0)\">\\((X,x_0)\\)</span> (pointed topological space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_0\\in S^n\">\\(s_0\\in S^n\\)</span> (basepoint of the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-sphere, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ed44d43cf74ca35e\" href=\"?note=ed44d43cf74ca35e\" title=\"58-df-sphere\">58-df-sphere</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[(S^n,s_0),(X,x_0)]_\\ast\">\\([(S^n,s_0),(X,x_0)]_\\ast\\)</span> (pointed homotopy classes)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_n:S^n\\to S^n\\vee S^n\">\\(p_n:S^n\\to S^n\\vee S^n\\)</span> (standard pinch map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star\">\\(\\star\\)</span> (candidate carrier and binary operation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\)</span> (group predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"58-df-group\">58-df-group</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomotopyGroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HomotopyGroup}_S\\)</span> (homotopy-group structure predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{HomotopyGroup}_S(G,\\star,X,\\tau_X,x_0,n,s_0,p_n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\\land s_0\\in S^n\\land p_n:S^n\\to S^n\\vee S^n\\land G=[(S^n,s_0),(X,x_0)]_\\ast\\land\\forall[f],[g]\\in G\\;\\bigl([f]\\star[g]=[(f\\vee g)\\circ p_n]\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\star)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{HomotopyGroup}_S(G,\\star,X,\\tau_X,x_0,n,s_0,p_n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\\land s_0\\in S^n\\land p_n:S^n\\to S^n\\vee S^n\\land G=[(S^n,s_0),(X,x_0)]_\\ast\\land\\forall[f],[g]\\in G\\;\\bigl([f]\\star[g]=[(f\\vee g)\\circ p_n]\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\star)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier consists of pointed homotopy classes of pointed maps <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^n\\to X\">\\(S^n\\to X\\)</span>; the pinch map supplies the group law.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_n\">\\(\\pi_n\\)</span> : higher-dimensional generalization of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1\">\\(\\pi_1\\)</span></li>\n<li>Hurewicz: first nonzero <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_n\">\\(\\pi_n\\)</span> gives isomorphism with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_n\">\\(H_n\\)</span></li>\n<li>Suspensions: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_n(X) \\to \\pi_{n+1}(\\Sigma X)\">\\(\\pi_n(X) \\to \\pi_{n+1}(\\Sigma X)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Abelianity for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq2\">\\(n\\geq2\\)</span> and Hurewicz are downstream theorems.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>May, A Concise Course in Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-homotopy","status":"resolved","id":"cc1ce993dd3ce56d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homotopy]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-group","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sphere","status":"resolved","id":"ed44d43cf74ca35e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sphere]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sphere","status":"resolved","id":"ed44d43cf74ca35e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s_0\\in S^n$ (basepoint of the $n$-sphere, see [[58-df-sphere]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-group","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S$ (group predicate, see [[58-df-group]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"(X,x_0)","display":false},{"tex":"s_0\\in S^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"[(S^n,s_0),(X,x_0)]_\\ast","display":false},{"tex":"p_n:S^n\\to S^n\\vee S^n","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\star","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HomotopyGroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{HomotopyGroup}_S(G,\\star,X,\\tau_X,x_0,n,s_0,p_n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\\land s_0\\in S^n\\land p_n:S^n\\to S^n\\vee S^n\\land G=[(S^n,s_0),(X,x_0)]_\\ast\\land\\forall[f],[g]\\in G\\;\\bigl([f]\\star[g]=[(f\\vee g)\\circ p_n]\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\star)","display":true},{"tex":"S^n\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"H_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_n(X) \\to \\pi_{n+1}(\\Sigma X)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq2","display":false}],"bytes":1672,"backlinks":[{"id":"ad55d3b2dfeece56","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"12ff4099e35b4ab6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],